hat\u2019s normal and what\u2019s not, and deliver the orders on time \u2014 or just escape.","steam_appid":3734310,"support_info":{"email":"835195862@qq.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Spain, German, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}